{"unit_id":"shuang-ying__dsh-ThirdApi-ThinkingMode#card-zh","repo":"shuang-ying/dsh-ThirdApi-ThinkingMode","commit":"65d88ea853896c16ee7260ce2aedb6231979de87","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-api-thinking（DSH 插件，任意客户端）：自动读取第三方 API 路由公布的模型思考档位，并同步到 DSH 的模型配置。它挂接 llm-pi-ai profile，通过模型清单识别支持的 reasoningEfforts，再经配置编辑器更新对应模型。支持 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 风格的模型清单、定时及配置变更后扫描、可选显示 off 或固定档位，并记录扫描状态。适合使用第三方模型路由并希望模型选择器反映实际推理档位的用户。需要配置相应模型路由；插件按路由配置请求其模型清单。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-60","lib/index.js:102-140","lib/index.js:390-413","lib/index.js:416-560"]}
{"unit_id":"shuang-ying__dsh-ThirdApi-ThinkingMode#card-en","repo":"shuang-ying/dsh-ThirdApi-ThinkingMode","commit":"65d88ea853896c16ee7260ce2aedb6231979de87","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-api-thinking (DSH plugin) syncs reasoning levels from third-party listings to llm-pi-ai. It scans at startup, periodically, or after profile changes; supports fixed and optional off levels; and records status. Useful when model pickers should reflect endpoint capabilities.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-60","lib/index.js:102-140","lib/index.js:390-413","lib/index.js:416-560"]}
